STRING 550
{
Lordaeron is infested with many creatures. When the Kingdom stood, Knights and Paladins would roam the land ensuring they never became a threat. After the Scourge and Demon invasion however these creatures now make their home where they please. This however offers opportunities to the Royal Apothecary to take advantage of the alchemical ingredients that can be harvested from these unique beasts.
}

